      "writtenOn": "2022-05-13T15:32:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I have a is a T and b is an S, a.padding.fRight(0) + b.padding.fLeft(2) \u003d\u003d 2 where P(T, S) \u003d 3. So, I think this is wrong because it would allow a distance of 2 when a distance of 3 is needed.",
