    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bbe8d12e_9825bdea",
        "filename": "tests/DrawOpAtlasTest.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 31
      },
      "lineNbr": 449,
      "author": {
        "id": 8956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-13T17:57:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why 3 is needed?\nS requires padding 2 around, and it\u0027s there.\nT requires padding 1 around, it has left and top and it borrows bottom and right (from S in this case, but could be from another T).\nIsn\u0027t it what we wanted in the first place? Reduce unnecessary padding?\nUnless, of course, I am mistaken, and padding \u003d\u003d 2 for SDFT does not consist of zeroes...",
      "parentUuid": "4ca16905_b5f94518",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 449,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 449,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "89fc1870a94ac37883ecc99b2b5f72ac03f6d29a",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "20b1a1b3_10db65ed",
        "filename": "tests/DrawOpAtlasTest.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 31
      },
      "lineNbr": 449,
