        "id": 5210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-13T18:25:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the padding around SDFT is not zero. The border around an SDFT glyph contains distance data, and Transformed glyphs need a zero border for the bi-linear interpolation to work correctly.\n\nI think my long definition of the relation P is the correct definition for the distance between the different rectangles.",
